    <node id="&quot;CREDIT PARTIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CLIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Credit Parties include various entities involved in a loan agreement who have rights to enforce the terms of the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities or individuals listed in the credit agreements that have specific rights or benefits related to the terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"amounts paid to the Company in violation of the limiting obligation shall be held in trust for the benefit of the Credit Parties."</data>
