    <node id="&quot;COMPANY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A legal entity involved in loan agreements and financial transactions, mentioned throughout the document."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity that establishes liens to secure intercompany Indebtedness."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity that may take a loan from lenders under specific terms, often with obligations to pay interest."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beneficially own or have the right to acquire voting equity securities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Company has the meaning specified in the preamble hereto."&lt;SEP&gt;"Company in this context refers to the entity providing the guarantee for the obligations of Borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entity that is involved in borrowing and lending activities in the document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the entity making references to rights or obligations in the listed agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the entity that incurs obligations and serves as an agent for Designated Borrowers in this financial document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the recognized legal entity involved in the credit agreements mentioned."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is a central entity involved in communications and notices with Lenders, Borrowers, and the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is a party involved in the Loan Document and is responsible for the obligations set forth therein."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is defined as the entity that is borrowing from the Lender under the terms of this Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is mentioned as a borrower under the Loan Documents and is responsible for obligations outlined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is referred to in connection with its activities surrounding loan agreements, compliance with laws, and maintenance of policies and procedures. Specifically, it indicates a potential borrowing entity involved in various financial agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is referred to in the context of an agreement which involves the Lenders and is a party to Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company may designate any additional Subsidiary of the Company as a Designated Borrower for purposes of receiving Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company refers to a corporate entity that borrows funds and is referenced throughout the document regarding its obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company refers to an unspecified organization involved in legal and financial agreements related to loans and benchmarks."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company refers to the borrower or entity involved in the agreement with the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company refers to the entity involved in the agreement. Its specific name is not mentioned, but it is involved in transactions and dealings with lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entity responsible for indemnification and payments as outlined in the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entity that is borrowing funds and must comply with various regulations and covenants outlined in the agreements with lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The obligations of the Company hereunder are those of primary obligor, and not merely assurety, and are independent of the Guarantee Obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The term 'Company' is referenced multiple times to denote an entity involved in the loan documents related to the Borrowers and Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The term 'Company' refers to the borrowing entity involved in this agreement, responsible for executing and delivering the Loan Documents as obligated."&lt;SEP&gt;"The term ‘Company’ refers to any corporate entity involved in activities or transactions as defined in the Loan Documents."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-43f64dca73b44adedaebc2187f68b166&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffdbb428153c0fe1a3165c4cb2b8b872&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1d195b7a76abc77df57b5e98867e935&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0ef17404552acd85a5f0a9f77bf1ba4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75ccbedc285afc25e0e2e720079c8043&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f7bd63830876e1fb1213d6af99f3a8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-268cc623f7e435f27e78919cc7b8fd2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e35c16e351795670d18ad6d77423f4e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5717298fa5f49a605f27b8da65de0aa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-100b5c975572f51636a61ac78458e899&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ddd8481502608245741dc4772c5ff1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2eab36c3a28bbe2353185d3b7d97705d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdd35a29472aa8b0d59ccabafd832cb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d5393964f1cfdb9294f3a9925fe0c93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2628557ba1269917afefe40986b27b9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9eb83712e5e65cd04210af22dead656a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7640e0f8a658bd7582ba0c105184de15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e9860cd859370389b2050b0328b04dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21340a4ca77d2f915d79e5381c251e61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f13c79bc5efcb269ff90c5b5cdf07eb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6dfde67bcc6c4100358b49b218bb541&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a32da08942b4e8f9bb0977d0f91b0056&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c27cff3d0a152feb2e0548cd9db039db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2b8cb98ea4aed2ec22248f62b71576b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1348b3bb0f9a013e8a032d2005afa392&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a80e94d1815c3927a9d45e840b95ae93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fee4592c80d303ac12e768cc7a7f8eb</data>
    </node>
