    <node id="&quot;AMAZON.COM, INC.&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A major global e-commerce and cloud computing company involved in a five-year revolving credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"AMAZON.COM, INC. is a Delaware corporation that has requested a revolving credit facility from various lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The signature page to the Five-Year Revolving Credit Agreement for AMAZON.COM, INC."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-dbf940ee222c487d04852f74ff7358a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4015d17cdefaed939b54860ada7329d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7295628aa9ed592731ce2c655152923</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DAILY COMPOUNDED CORRA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An interest calculation method used for loans denominated in Canadian Dollars based on the Canadian Overnight Repo Rate Average."&lt;SEP&gt;"Daily Compounded CORRA is an interest rate representing the compounding of the CORRA rates over a given period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Daily Compounded CORRA means, for any day, CORRA with interest accruing on a compounded daily basis."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-44cbda306a219cd25993684f899ea606&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2b8cb98ea4aed2ec22248f62b71576b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c27cff3d0a152feb2e0548cd9db039db</data>
