    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CITIBANK, N.A.&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"CITIBANK, N.A. acts as Administrative Agent in the Revolving Credit Agreement of AMAZON.COM, INC."&lt;SEP&gt;"CITIBANK, N.A. serves as the Administrative Agent for the revolving credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Citibank, N.A., in its capacities as sole lead arranger and joint bookrunner."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each of the Lenders hereby irrevocably appoints Citibank, N.A. to act as the Administrative Agent..."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1f7bd63830876e1fb1213d6af99f3a8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4015d17cdefaed939b54860ada7329d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7295628aa9ed592731ce2c655152923&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23dea383c562ae70d7e649da50b7400e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DAILY SIMPLE SOFR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An interest calculation method used for US Dollar loans based on the secured overnight financing rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Daily Simple SOFR is a specific type of RFR used for calculating interest on loans in reference to the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Daily Simple SOFR is an interest rate that reflects the cost of borrowing cash overnight secured by Treasury securities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Daily Simple SOFR means, for any day, an interest rate per annum based on the Daily Simple SOFR Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Daily Simple Secured Overnight Financing Rate used in short-term loans."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-fdd35a29472aa8b0d59ccabafd832cb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2b8cb98ea4aed2ec22248f62b71576b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e9860cd859370389b2050b0328b04dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c27cff3d0a152feb2e0548cd9db039db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44cbda306a219cd25993684f899ea606</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MATERIAL INDEBTEDNESS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Material Indebtedness refers to significant debt obligations, typically defined as those exceeding a certain threshold."&lt;SEP&gt;"The sum of indebtedness that the Company or any Subsidiary is responsible for."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a32da08942b4e8f9bb0977d0f91b0056&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de5a35f05e33d55963235061fcfdced5</data>
    </node>
