    <node id="&quot;LENDERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CLIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Each Lender represents and warrants that the Loan Documents set forth the terms of a commercial lending facility, and is engaged in making, acquiring or holding commercial loans and providing other facilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities or individuals that provide loans to the Company and Borrowers under defined conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders are financial entities that provide loans to Borrowers under the terms stated in the document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders under the LoanDocuments; provided, however, that upon the occurrence of an actual or deemed entry of an order for relief..."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lenders are financial institutions or individuals that provide loans and may receive payments for services rendered under the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The term LENDERS refers to multiple entities that are providing a revolving credit facility to AMAZON.COM, INC."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-fdd35a29472aa8b0d59ccabafd832cb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75ccbedc285afc25e0e2e720079c8043&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b7295628aa9ed592731ce2c655152923&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6dfde67bcc6c4100358b49b218bb541&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f7bd63830876e1fb1213d6af99f3a8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2eab36c3a28bbe2353185d3b7d97705d</data>
    </node>
