      <data key="d1">"All obligations and arrangements within the context of laws aimed at providing relief to debtors."&lt;SEP&gt;"Debtor Relief Laws encompasses legal statutes that provide relief for debtors in financial distress."&lt;SEP&gt;"Debtor Relief Laws means the Bankruptcy Code of the United States and all other applicable laws."&lt;SEP&gt;"any other applicable Debtor Relief Laws applicable to Borrowers under the loan agreement."</data>
