    <node id="&quot;SUBSIDIARIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Certain SUBSIDIARIES of the Company are included as parties to the agreement as Designated Borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities controlled by the Company, referenced in the context of financial conditions and obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities under the Company that are involved in financial operations including borrowing. They may merge or consolidate with other entities."</data>
