    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CLIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A party that receives loans and is subject to various obligations, covenants, and events of default."&lt;SEP&gt;"A party that receives loans from lenders and agrees to pay them back under specified terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity that receives a loan and is subject to deliver incumbency certificates."&lt;SEP&gt;"An individual or entity that receives funds from a lender and is obligated to repay the loan according to the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any Borrower is defined as any entity that is involved in a financial agreement with a Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any individual or entity that has obtained a loan from a lender, subject to various compliance requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrower refers to any entity that receives Loans made by a Lender, as defined in the Loan documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrower refers to any individual or entity receiving loans from the Lenders, as indicated in the commitments made."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrower refers to any party involved in taking a loan from the Lender as per this agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrower refers to the entity receiving loans from the Lender under the terms of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrowers are entities that undertake loans from Lenders and may incur obligations as per the loan agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrowers are individuals or entities receiving loans and are subject to notifications from the Administrative Agent and Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities that receive loans and have obligations outlined in the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is the individual or entity that requests and receives funds from the Lenders under the terms specified in the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entities that are borrowing under the agreement and subject to its terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entity that receives loans from the Lenders under the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"The term 'Borrower' indicates an individual or corporation that is receiving funds from a Lender under the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The term 'Borrower' refers to the entities or individuals that receive loans from lenders under certain agreements and are obligated to repay such loans as per the terms set forth in the contract."&lt;SEP&gt;"upon the occurrence of an actual or deemed entry of an order for relief with respect to any Borrower under the Bankruptcy Code..."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-43f64dca73b44adedaebc2187f68b166&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1d195b7a76abc77df57b5e98867e935&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0ef17404552acd85a5f0a9f77bf1ba4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f7bd63830876e1fb1213d6af99f3a8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e35c16e351795670d18ad6d77423f4e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5717298fa5f49a605f27b8da65de0aa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-100b5c975572f51636a61ac78458e899&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ddd8481502608245741dc4772c5ff1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9899bf9fb2f1e9c4c871968bb39877aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2eab36c3a28bbe2353185d3b7d97705d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d5393964f1cfdb9294f3a9925fe0c93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9eb83712e5e65cd04210af22dead656a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8390f90a484fc0fc4f7fecf58c01c94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e9860cd859370389b2050b0328b04dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f13c79bc5efcb269ff90c5b5cdf07eb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6dfde67bcc6c4100358b49b218bb541&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c27cff3d0a152feb2e0548cd9db039db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a32da08942b4e8f9bb0977d0f91b0056&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a80e94d1815c3927a9d45e840b95ae93</data>
    </node>
