      <data key="d1">"A legal provision that allows for the restructuring or discharge of debts in certain circumstances."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any legal proceedings related to the restructuring of a company's debt, potentially impacting lenders and borrowers in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Debtor Relief Law encompasses legal frameworks and statutes aimed at providing relief to debtors facing financial difficulties, relevant to the Borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Laws that provide for the relief of debtors in financial distress, allowing for reorganization or liquidation of debts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legal frameworks designed to protect the rights of debtors and oversee bankruptcy processes."</data>
