      <data key="d2">chunk-b7295628aa9ed592731ce2c655152923</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EXCLUDED TAXES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Detailed taxes that do not apply to the transactions handled within the agreement, affecting overall fiscal responsibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes that are not applicable to the payment obligations under the agreement, impacting net cash flow for the involved entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes that are not included when determining the total amounts payable under financial agreements."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-43f64dca73b44adedaebc2187f68b166&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21340a4ca77d2f915d79e5381c251e61</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INDEMNIFIED TAXES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Indemnified Taxes are additional costs that may arise for the Borrower in relation to the loans taken, as part of the financial obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Indemnified Taxes are amounts that Borrowers may need to pay or indemnify for any taxes assessed."&lt;SEP&gt;"Indemnified Taxes are taxes that a borrower has to cover or compensate, which may include various forms of taxation imposed on payments."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-de5a35f05e33d55963235061fcfdced5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e9860cd859370389b2050b0328b04dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6dfde67bcc6c4100358b49b218bb541</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COVENANTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Conditions or clauses in the Loan Document that outline the obligations and rights of the parties involved."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5717298fa5f49a605f27b8da65de0aa3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INDEMNIFICATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Indemnification refers to the mechanism through which the Company agrees to compensate the Lender for losses or expenses incurred."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7e9860cd859370389b2050b0328b04dc</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COUNTERPARTS AGREEMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Counterparts Agreement allows for the execution of the agreement in parts while still considering them as a whole contract."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2628557ba1269917afefe40986b27b9f</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BARCLAYS BANK PLC.&quot;">
