      <data key="d1">"BARCLAYS BANK PLC is a lending institution that is part of the lenders providing a revolving credit facility to AMAZON.COM, INC."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b7295628aa9ed592731ce2c655152923</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DEFAULTING LENDER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CLIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Defaulting Lender is defined as a lender that fails to meet its obligations under the loan agreement, affecting the setoff rights."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Defaulting Lender is described as a participant whose removal can be initiated by the Required Lenders if necessary due to specific criteria."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Defaulting Lender is one whose right to approve or disapprove any amendment, waiver, or consent is restricted."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Lender that has failed to meet its financial obligations as per the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A classification for lenders who fail to meet their obligations, affecting the operational landscape of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Defaulting Lender refers to lenders who have failed to fulfill their obligations under a loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"No Defaulting Lender has the right to approve any amendment, waiver, or consent under this Agreement unless specifically affected."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2628557ba1269917afefe40986b27b9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffdbb428153c0fe1a3165c4cb2b8b872&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0ef17404552acd85a5f0a9f77bf1ba4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75ccbedc285afc25e0e2e720079c8043&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21340a4ca77d2f915d79e5381c251e61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fee4592c80d303ac12e768cc7a7f8eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de5a35f05e33d55963235061fcfdced5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;OTHER TAXES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Other Taxes refer to any additional taxes that Borrowers are responsible for paying to Governmental Authorities under applicable laws."&lt;SEP&gt;"Other Taxes refer to any types of taxes not classified under Excluded Taxes that can arise in financial contexts or transactions."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-de5a35f05e33d55963235061fcfdced5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6dfde67bcc6c4100358b49b218bb541</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DELAWARE LAW&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LAW"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The set of laws governing the aspects of business entities, specifically in the state of Delaware."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5717298fa5f49a605f27b8da65de0aa3</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AFFILIATES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Affiliates refer to companies related to the Lender or Borrower but are not necessarily part of the core agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Affiliates refer to other entities associated with the Lender that may also play a role in lending activities."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7e9860cd859370389b2050b0328b04dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d5393964f1cfdb9294f3a9925fe0c93</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SURVIVAL OF REPRESENTATIONS AND WARRANTIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Survival clause ensures all claims and warranties made remain effective even after execution of the loan agreement."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2628557ba1269917afefe40986b27b9f</data>
