    <node id="&quot;GOVERNMENTAL AUTHORITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"'Governmental Authority' refers to a government body that oversees the enforcement of laws and regulations, including those affecting taxes."&lt;SEP&gt;"An authority or regulatory body with the power to govern issues related to lenders and borrowers, influencing regulations and compliance."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity that collects taxes and oversees the implementation of various laws related to taxation, involved in the payment processes described."&lt;SEP&gt;"Governmental Authorities are bodies that may impose taxes or regulations affecting the transactions discussed in this document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Governmental Authority refers to any governmental body or entity with jurisdiction over specific legal matters."&lt;SEP&gt;"Governmental Authority refers to any governmental organization or agency that enforces laws or regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Governmental Authority refers to the relevant government bodies involved in the regulation and oversight of agreements and loans."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-43f64dca73b44adedaebc2187f68b166&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8390f90a484fc0fc4f7fecf58c01c94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21340a4ca77d2f915d79e5381c251e61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f13c79bc5efcb269ff90c5b5cdf07eb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6dfde67bcc6c4100358b49b218bb541&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de5a35f05e33d55963235061fcfdced5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9899bf9fb2f1e9c4c871968bb39877aa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ASSIGNMENT AND ASSUMPTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A process through which the responsibilities and rights of Lenders can be transferred or assigned."&lt;SEP&gt;"Assignment and Assumption is a legal process where one party transfers its rights and obligations under a loan or contract to another party."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-de5a35f05e33d55963235061fcfdced5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0ef17404552acd85a5f0a9f77bf1ba4</data>
