    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AFFILIATE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Affiliate denotes any subsidiary or related company that is connected to the primary borrowing entity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Affiliate refers to any entity that is directly or indirectly controlled by another entity, typically through ownership or shared interests."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Affiliate is a subordinate or associated organization that may have a close relationship with the Administrative Agent or Lenders, helping in the execution of functions."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Affiliate refers to a related entity to the Lender, typically holding deposits or obligations tied to the primary lending institution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities or individuals that are closely related or connected to the Indemnitees, sharing rights or obligations."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2628557ba1269917afefe40986b27b9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1d195b7a76abc77df57b5e98867e935&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75ccbedc285afc25e0e2e720079c8043&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f13c79bc5efcb269ff90c5b5cdf07eb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de5a35f05e33d55963235061fcfdced5</data>
    </node>
