      <data key="d1">"A Loan Notice is a formal request from the Borrower to the Lender indicating a desire to draw down on the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Loan Notice must be received by the Administrative Agent not later than 1:00 p.m., New York City time."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-96327e67f3059bf562671f661d306a08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f13c79bc5efcb269ff90c5b5cdf07eb2</data>
