      <data key="d1">"A specific group of lenders whose consent is necessary for certain amendments, waivers, or modifications to this Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Group of lenders required to approve changes to Loan agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders that determine the conditions under which loans may convert or continue during an Event of Default."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders whose consent is necessary for specific actions, such as extending the Maturity Date."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders with sufficient voting power as specified in the Loan Documents, play a crucial role in decision-making."&lt;SEP&gt;"Required Lenders are defined as those needed to approve the resignation of the Administrative Agent and appoint a successor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Required Lenders are the group of Lenders whose approval is necessary for certain actions or changes outlined in the loan agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Required Lenders are those whose approval is necessary for amendments, waivers, or consents related to the Loan Agreement."</data>
