      <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"At least five Business Days' prior written notice is required for amendments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Business Days are defined as days when banking institutions are open to conduct financial transactions, often excluding weekends and holidays."&lt;SEP&gt;"Business Days refer to days when businesses operate, excluding weekends and public holidays, potentially impacting the timing of obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Days designated for conducting business transactions, excluding weekends and holidays."&lt;SEP&gt;"Days on which business is conducted and services are available, often excluding weekends and holidays."&lt;SEP&gt;"Days recognized as valid for business transactions, impacting loan notice requirements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Days when business transactions typically occur, impacting loan processes and notifications."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legally recognized days in which parties must respond or act within a specified time frame."</data>
