    <node id="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CLIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A 'Lender' is an entity or institution that provides loans to borrowers, expecting repayment with interest according to predefined terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Lender provides loans to the Company under the defined terms and may be subject to default provisions outlined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A party that makes loans available to borrowers, often in a financial context."&lt;SEP&gt;"A party that provides loans under the terms of an agreement, specifically referenced as parties in the loan documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity or individual that provides funds to borrowers based on agreed terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity that provides loans and has total credit exposure representing more than 50% of the total credit exposures of all lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any Lender may at any time, without the consent of, or notice to, any Borrower or the Administrative Agent, sell participations to any Person."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities involved in providing loans to the Company under the credit agreements mentioned."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities that may assign or transfer rights and obligations under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Financial institutions or entities that provide loans to the Borrowers, establishing a significant financial relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"Financial institutions or individuals that provide loans to the Borrowers, entitled to indemnification under the Loan Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lender is a party that provides loans to the Company and is involved in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lender is an entity that provides Loans to Borrowers, and is defined within the context of the Loan documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lender is the entity or individual providing loans to the borrowing parties under the terms specified in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lender pertains to the entities providing Loans to the Company, thereby establishing a financial relationship with payment obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lender refers to any bank or financial institution that provides capital under the agreements discussed."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lender refers to any financial institution or entity that provides loans to borrowers as specified in the loan agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lender refers to any person or entity that provides loans, typically under certain agreements and obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lender refers to entities that provide loans and financing under the Loan Documents, with certain rights and obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lender refers to the entity providing funds to Borrowers under the terms of the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lender refers to the financial entity providing loans to the Company under agreed terms and conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders are financial entities engaged in providing loans and receiving payments as part of lending agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders are financial institutions or entities that provide loans to the Company under specified terms and conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders are the individuals or entities providing loans and have the right to receive notices and communications regarding the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to individuals or entities that provide loans under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender's approval is necessary for amendments or waivers affecting their commitments or payments."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-43f64dca73b44adedaebc2187f68b166&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1d195b7a76abc77df57b5e98867e935&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0ef17404552acd85a5f0a9f77bf1ba4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23dea383c562ae70d7e649da50b7400e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-268cc623f7e435f27e78919cc7b8fd2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e35c16e351795670d18ad6d77423f4e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5717298fa5f49a605f27b8da65de0aa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-100b5c975572f51636a61ac78458e899&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ddd8481502608245741dc4772c5ff1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de5a35f05e33d55963235061fcfdced5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9899bf9fb2f1e9c4c871968bb39877aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d5393964f1cfdb9294f3a9925fe0c93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2628557ba1269917afefe40986b27b9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9eb83712e5e65cd04210af22dead656a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7640e0f8a658bd7582ba0c105184de15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8390f90a484fc0fc4f7fecf58c01c94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e9860cd859370389b2050b0328b04dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21340a4ca77d2f915d79e5381c251e61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f13c79bc5efcb269ff90c5b5cdf07eb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c27cff3d0a152feb2e0548cd9db039db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2b8cb98ea4aed2ec22248f62b71576b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44cbda306a219cd25993684f899ea606&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1348b3bb0f9a013e8a032d2005afa392&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4015d17cdefaed939b54860ada7329d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a80e94d1815c3927a9d45e840b95ae93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fee4592c80d303ac12e768cc7a7f8eb</data>
