      <data key="d1">"Loans that are linked to a specific benchmark rate, which are repaid over a predetermined period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loans that are subject to specific benchmark interest rates noted within the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Term Benchmark Loans are loans whose interest rates are pegged to specific benchmark rates over defined terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Term Benchmark Loans are types of loans where interest rates are determined based on a specific benchmark rate over a predetermined term."&lt;SEP&gt;"Term Benchmark Loans refer to loans linked to a specified benchmark rate over a defined term."&lt;SEP&gt;"Term Benchmark Loans refer to the loans that have a fixed duration and are based on defined financial benchmarks."&lt;SEP&gt;"Term Benchmark Loans referenced in the document imply structured loan options within different currencies."</data>
