    <node id="&quot;AUD BANK BILL RATE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"AUD Bank Bill Rate is a financial benchmark rate used for loans denominated in Australian Dollars."&lt;SEP&gt;"AUD Bank Bill Rate is used as a benchmark for determining interest rates on loans in the Australian context."&lt;SEP&gt;"The average interest rate at which Australian banks lend to one another for terms of less than one year."</data>
