    <node id="&quot;OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Obligations detail the borrower's responsibilities and commitments as stated in the loan agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations refer to the financial duties the Borrower has to fulfill under the terms outlined in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations refer to the financial responsibilities and debts that the Designated Borrowers hold."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations refer to the overall financial responsibilities of the Borrowers as detailed in the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations refer to the responsibilities or commitments that parties have under the terms of a contract, which must be fulfilled."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations refer to the total liabilities or debts that Borrowers owe to Lenders as per the loan agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The duties or debts that the Borrowers are required to fulfill under the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The formal commitments that the Borrower has agreed to in relation to the loans received."&lt;SEP&gt;"The obligations of the Company hereunder are independent of the Guarantee Obligations and the obligations of any other guarantor."&lt;SEP&gt;"The responsibilities that arise under the loan agreement, which parties must fulfill."&lt;SEP&gt;"any amounts received on account of the Obligations shall be applied by the Administrative Agent in the following order..."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2628557ba1269917afefe40986b27b9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffdbb428153c0fe1a3165c4cb2b8b872&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1d195b7a76abc77df57b5e98867e935&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a32da08942b4e8f9bb0977d0f91b0056&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e9860cd859370389b2050b0328b04dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-268cc623f7e435f27e78919cc7b8fd2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4015d17cdefaed939b54860ada7329d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f7bd63830876e1fb1213d6af99f3a8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fee4592c80d303ac12e768cc7a7f8eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2b8cb98ea4aed2ec22248f62b71576b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9899bf9fb2f1e9c4c871968bb39877aa</data>
    </node>
