      <data key="d1">"Benchmark Replacement refers to the alternative interest rate established when the existing benchmark is no longer available."&lt;SEP&gt;"Benchmark Replacement refers to the process of substituting a benchmark interest rate due to changes in the financial markets or regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Substituting the current benchmark used for interest calculations."</data>
