    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SANCTIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Penalties or restrictions imposed by governments or international bodies, relevant in financial transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Restrictions imposed by governmental bodies to restrict financial transactions with certain jurisdictions or entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sanctions outline legal restrictions that may affect the Company and its subsidiaries, referring to laws that impact international cooperation and financial transactions."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-44cbda306a219cd25993684f899ea606&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1348b3bb0f9a013e8a032d2005afa392&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a32da08942b4e8f9bb0977d0f91b0056</data>
    </node>
