    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NON-EXTENDING LENDER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CLIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Lender that declines to extend the Maturity Date as requested by the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commitment of each Non-Extending Lender shall terminate on the Existing Maturity Date, along with any outstanding Loans made by such lender."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-e35c16e351795670d18ad6d77423f4e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffdbb428153c0fe1a3165c4cb2b8b872</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LOAN DOCUMENTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Legal documents that outline the terms of the Loans provided to Borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Documents include all agreements and legal documents relevant to the lending process between Borrowers, Lenders, and the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Documents is a term that encompasses all agreements and documents related to a borrowing transaction."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Documents refer to the legal agreements that outline terms between the borrower and lender regarding loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Documents refer to the various agreements and contracts that outline the terms and conditions of the loans provided by Lenders to Borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Documents set forth the terms of a commercial lending facility, and details various duties and responsibilities of the Administrative Agent and the Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan Documents encompass the agreements related to the lending transactions between the Company and the Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Various legal documents governing the terms and conditions of the loans provided to the Borrowers."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2628557ba1269917afefe40986b27b9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9eb83712e5e65cd04210af22dead656a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7398756e5d9f35912e2cc6d9774a28be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0ef17404552acd85a5f0a9f77bf1ba4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75ccbedc285afc25e0e2e720079c8043&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a80e94d1815c3927a9d45e840b95ae93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de5a35f05e33d55963235061fcfdced5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-268cc623f7e435f27e78919cc7b8fd2e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT'S BOOKS AND RECORDS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Administrative Agent's books and records are the financial documents that track the Guarantee Obligations and related transactions."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-268cc623f7e435f27e78919cc7b8fd2e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JOYCE P. DORSETT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"AUTHOR"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Senior Vice President representing U.S. Bank National Association in the agreement."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-dbf940ee222c487d04852f74ff7358a4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A party responsible for overseeing the assignment and transfer of rights or obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"A representative acting on behalf of the lenders, involved in the administration of the Loan Agreement and related documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Administrative Agent is responsible for managing the loan agreements and communications between Borrowers and Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Administrative Agent refers to an individual or firm that acts on behalf of the Lenders in this agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Administrative Agent refers to the entity appointed to manage the loan agreements and disbursements among Lenders and Borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity acting on behalf of lenders to take actions upon events of default related to loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity responsible for managing loan transactions and ensuring compliance with agreements between lenders and borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"An individual or entity designated to manage the loan agreement and act in the interests of all lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entity responsible for managing loans and interest periods."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the entity managing the loan agreement, ensuring lenders' interests are upheld."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 'Administrative Agent' is an entity appointed by lenders to act on their behalf in administering the loan agreements and ensuring compliance with the terms of those agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent acts on behalf of the Lenders in terms of distributing notices, communications, and enforcement of rights under the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent acts on behalf of the lenders and is involved in the giving and receipt of notices, as well as facilitating loan transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent facilitates communication and transaction execution between Lenders and Borrowers under this Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent facilitates the loan process and communicates between the Lenders and Borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent is a financial institution or entity that acts on behalf of all lenders in a loan syndication."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent is a party that administers the loan agreements and manages payments among the lenders and borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent is an entity that oversees the administrative functions of the loan and is involved in the agreement process."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent is responsible for communicating decisions related to Defaulting Lenders and Designated Borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent is responsible for managing agreements and communications between the Company and the Lenders regarding loan agreements and benchmark replacements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent is responsible for managing and overseeing compliance with the funding obligations outlined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent is the entity responsible for administering the loan agreement and managing the relationship between lenders and borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent may perform any and all of its duties and exercise its rights and powers hereunder or under any other Loan Document by or through any one or more sub-agents appointed by the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent operates in the context of loan agreements and is involved in managing payments and obligations of borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent operates on behalf of Lenders, handling various tasks related to loan documentation and management."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent shall promptly notify each Lender of the details thereof."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent's consent is required for amendments or waivers of provisions in this Agreement or Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"The administrative agent represents the entity that arranges the agreement and represents lenders in the loan transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entity responsible for managing the loans and informing the Borrowers and Lenders of important financial details."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entity that oversees the management of the loans and serves as an intermediary between the Borrowers and Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The provisions of this Article (other than the Company’s consent rights in Section 9.06) are solely for the benefit of the Administrative Agent and the Lenders..."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-43f64dca73b44adedaebc2187f68b166&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffdbb428153c0fe1a3165c4cb2b8b872&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1d195b7a76abc77df57b5e98867e935&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0ef17404552acd85a5f0a9f77bf1ba4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75ccbedc285afc25e0e2e720079c8043&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f7bd63830876e1fb1213d6af99f3a8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-268cc623f7e435f27e78919cc7b8fd2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e35c16e351795670d18ad6d77423f4e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c78c300be543864443a46def23942a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5717298fa5f49a605f27b8da65de0aa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ddd8481502608245741dc4772c5ff1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de5a35f05e33d55963235061fcfdced5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9899bf9fb2f1e9c4c871968bb39877aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2eab36c3a28bbe2353185d3b7d97705d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdd35a29472aa8b0d59ccabafd832cb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d5393964f1cfdb9294f3a9925fe0c93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2628557ba1269917afefe40986b27b9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9eb83712e5e65cd04210af22dead656a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7398756e5d9f35912e2cc6d9774a28be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e9860cd859370389b2050b0328b04dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21340a4ca77d2f915d79e5381c251e61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f13c79bc5efcb269ff90c5b5cdf07eb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6dfde67bcc6c4100358b49b218bb541&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2b8cb98ea4aed2ec22248f62b71576b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a32da08942b4e8f9bb0977d0f91b0056&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c27cff3d0a152feb2e0548cd9db039db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96327e67f3059bf562671f661d306a08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4112e65b1f4508cbb34a7b3f96ce6ae4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4015d17cdefaed939b54860ada7329d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a80e94d1815c3927a9d45e840b95ae93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fee4592c80d303ac12e768cc7a7f8eb</data>
    </node>
