      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The obligations of each Designated Borrower are guaranteed by the Company under the Guaranty set forth in Article X."&lt;SEP&gt;"This Guaranty is a continuing and irrevocable guaranty of all Guarantee Obligations now or hereafter existing."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ffdbb428153c0fe1a3165c4cb2b8b872&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fee4592c80d303ac12e768cc7a7f8eb</data>
