      <data key="d2">chunk-dbf940ee222c487d04852f74ff7358a4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LOAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A financial agreement under which the Lender provides a specified amount of money to the Borrower, to be repaid with interest."&lt;SEP&gt;"A sum of money that is borrowed and expected to be paid back with interest."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan indicates a financial transaction in which money is lent with the expectation of being paid back, often including interest."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan refers to the amount of money borrowed that is expected to be paid back with interest over a specified period."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan refers to the financial transaction where a Lender provides funds to a Borrower under agreed terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the funds advanced by lenders as part of the credit agreements."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7398756e5d9f35912e2cc6d9774a28be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7640e0f8a658bd7582ba0c105184de15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1d195b7a76abc77df57b5e98867e935&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5717298fa5f49a605f27b8da65de0aa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c27cff3d0a152feb2e0548cd9db039db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de5a35f05e33d55963235061fcfdced5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EURIBOR BORROWING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Euro Interbank Offered Rate for determining interest rates in Euro-denominated loans."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-44cbda306a219cd25993684f899ea606</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EXISTING MATURITY DATE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Existing Maturity Date is the deadline for the termination of commitments by the Non-Extending Lender."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ffdbb428153c0fe1a3165c4cb2b8b872</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ARTICLE II&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Article II defines specific provisions related to notices and communications to Lenders that may contain material nonpublic information (MNPI)."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9eb83712e5e65cd04210af22dead656a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BANK OF CHINA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lender involved in the credit agreement with Amazon.com, Inc."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-dbf940ee222c487d04852f74ff7358a4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BASE RATE BORROWING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Base Rate Borrowing refers to loans that use a pre-defined base rate as the benchmark for interest calculations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Base Rate Borrowing represents any borrowing comprised of loans that bear interest at a rate based on the Base Rate."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2eab36c3a28bbe2353185d3b7d97705d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7398756e5d9f35912e2cc6d9774a28be</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TIBOR BORROWING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Tokyo Interbank Offered Rate, relevant for loans in Japanese Yen."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-44cbda306a219cd25993684f899ea606</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ARTICLE X&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Article X delineates obligations and guarantees with respect to Designated Borrowers and the Company."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ffdbb428153c0fe1a3165c4cb2b8b872</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AGENT PARTIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Agent Parties include the Administrative Agent and any associated parties involved in managing loan agreements and communications."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9eb83712e5e65cd04210af22dead656a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NATIONAL WESTMINSTER BANK PLC&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Another lender taking part in Amazon.com's revolving credit agreement."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-dbf940ee222c487d04852f74ff7358a4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BASE RATE LOAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Base Rate Loan is a type of loan that has an interest rate based on the Base Rate, linking it directly to fluctuations in the Base Rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"Type of loan characterized by interest rates based on a specified base rate."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5c78c300be543864443a46def23942a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7398756e5d9f35912e2cc6d9774a28be</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TERM SOFR LOAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A type of loan that bears interest based on the forward-looking term SOFR rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Type of loan that bears interest based on the Term SOFR rate."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-44cbda306a219cd25993684f899ea606&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c78c300be543864443a46def23942a2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;APPLICANT BORROWER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CLIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An Applicant Borrower is a subsidiary designated by the Company to receive Loans, subject to approval from the Lenders."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ffdbb428153c0fe1a3165c4cb2b8b872</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RELATED PARTIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Entities associated with the Administrative Agent and the Lenders, often involving consent in assignments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Related Parties are individuals or entities related to the Lender or Borrower, which may require knowledge of the Information disclosed."&lt;SEP&gt;"Related Parties are individuals or entities that may have connections or interests in the transactions involving the Borrowers, Lenders, and Administrative Agent."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f0ef17404552acd85a5f0a9f77bf1ba4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d5393964f1cfdb9294f3a9925fe0c93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9eb83712e5e65cd04210af22dead656a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STANDARD CHARTERED BANK&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Engaged as a lender in the five-year revolving credit agreement with Amazon.com, Inc."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-dbf940ee222c487d04852f74ff7358a4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RELEVANT RATE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Relevant Rate refers to the specific interest rate that is applicable to loans denominated in an agreed currency."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 'Relevant Rate' pertains to interest rates that are applicable under specific loan agreements and can be subject to change depending on market conditions."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9899bf9fb2f1e9c4c871968bb39877aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7398756e5d9f35912e2cc6d9774a28be</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TERM CORRA LOAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A loan linked to the forward-looking rate based on the Canadian Overnight Repo Rate Average."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan that bears interest based on the Term CORRA."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-44cbda306a219cd25993684f899ea606&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c78c300be543864443a46def23942a2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;REGULATORY INFORMATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Regulatory Information includes all documentation and data required to comply with regulatory authorities’ requirements for Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulatory Information includes documents or data that the lenders may require for compliance and assessment purposes."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulatory Information is classified as information required by the Lender related to regulatory compliance."&lt;SEP&gt;"This encompasses information requested from Borrowers to ensure compliance with regulations and laws in lending circumstances."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-f13c79bc5efcb269ff90c5b5cdf07eb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ddd8481502608245741dc4772c5ff1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e9860cd859370389b2050b0328b04dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffdbb428153c0fe1a3165c4cb2b8b872</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CONTRACT RIGHTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Contract Rights are the entitlements outlined in the Loan Documents that dictate the rights and remedies available to Lenders and the Administrative Agent."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9eb83712e5e65cd04210af22dead656a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;U.S. BANK NATIONAL ASSOCIATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Acting as a lender in the five-year revolving credit agreement for Amazon.com, Inc."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-dbf940ee222c487d04852f74ff7358a4</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KNOW YOUR CUSTOMER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Know Your Customer is a regulatory framework that mandates banks and financial institutions to verify the identities of their clients."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ffdbb428153c0fe1a3165c4cb2b8b872</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AGREED CURRENCY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Agreed Currency is the currency that has been specifically designated in loan agreements for reference and transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Agreed Currency refers to the specific currency agreed upon by the parties involved in the loan agreement for the transaction."&lt;SEP&gt;"Agreed Currency signifies the currency that has been mutually accepted by all parties in a financial transaction or contract."&lt;SEP&gt;"The currency under which the loan transactions are agreed upon between parties."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-96327e67f3059bf562671f661d306a08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2eab36c3a28bbe2353185d3b7d97705d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9899bf9fb2f1e9c4c871968bb39877aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7398756e5d9f35912e2cc6d9774a28be</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SECTION 3.03&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Section 3.03 discusses the terms under which an alternate rate of interest is applied if certain benchmark conditions are not met."&lt;SEP&gt;"Specific legal or financial provisions referenced in transactions related to RFR loans."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-44cbda306a219cd25993684f899ea606&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9899bf9fb2f1e9c4c871968bb39877aa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EXPENSES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Costs incurred that may be reimbursed or indemnified under the terms of the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Expenses refer to costs incurred by the Administrative Agent, Lenders, or Borrowers in relation to the management of loans and legal documentation."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b1d195b7a76abc77df57b5e98867e935&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9eb83712e5e65cd04210af22dead656a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BENCHMARK REPLACEMENT DATE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Benchmark Replacement Date signifies the earliest occurrence of events that determine when the current benchmark is replaced with a new benchmark."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date on which a replacement benchmark is established in place of a previously used benchmark, especially in legal or financial contexts."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-df1d1358e8eeda6882c1fa2a74d036e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7398756e5d9f35912e2cc6d9774a28be</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BORROWING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The act of obtaining funds, typically characterized by the terms and conditions under which they are provided."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-44cbda306a219cd25993684f899ea606</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ANTI-MONEY LAUNDERING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Anti-Money Laundering refers to regulations aimed at preventing the illegal generation of income through restrictions on financial transactions."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ffdbb428153c0fe1a3165c4cb2b8b872</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INDEMNITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Indemnity refers to the obligation of the Company to compensate the Administrative Agent and Lenders for any losses or damages they may incur."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9eb83712e5e65cd04210af22dead656a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BENCHMARK REPLACEMENT ADJUSTMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Adjustment applied to the Benchmark Replacement as per financial regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Benchmark Replacement Adjustment refers to the spread adjustment that is applied when replacing a current benchmark with a new one."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5c78c300be543864443a46def23942a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7398756e5d9f35912e2cc6d9774a28be</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SUBSTITUTED TERMS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Terms that are replaced or altered in financial agreements based on certain conditions or regulations."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-44cbda306a219cd25993684f899ea606</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COURT OF COMPETENT JURISDICTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Court of Competent Jurisdiction is a legal forum with the authority to adjudicate disputes or controversies under law."&lt;SEP&gt;"A legal venue with the authority to adjudicate matters related to the Loan Agreement and indemnity disputes."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b1d195b7a76abc77df57b5e98867e935&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffdbb428153c0fe1a3165c4cb2b8b872</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SECTION 11.04&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Each Lender shall be responsible for the indemnity under Section 11.04(c) without regard to the existence of any participation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Section 11.04 discusses the costs, indemnity provisions, and limitations of liability associated with the Loan Documents."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8d5393964f1cfdb9294f3a9925fe0c93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9eb83712e5e65cd04210af22dead656a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FLOOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Floor in this context refers to the minimum value that may be assigned to a replacement benchmark, ensuring it does not fall below a specified level."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-7398756e5d9f35912e2cc6d9774a28be</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CURRENCY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Forms of money issued by a governmental entity, used for transactions across goods and services."&lt;SEP&gt;"Type of medium (like US Dollars, Euro, etc.) in which the Loans are denominated."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-44cbda306a219cd25993684f899ea606&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fdd35a29472aa8b0d59ccabafd832cb5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COMMITMENT FEE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Commitment Fee is a fee charged to borrowers for the unused portion of a credit facility over a specified period."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ffdbb428153c0fe1a3165c4cb2b8b872</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;REQUESTS FOR NOTICES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Requests for Notices are formal communications where Borrowers and Lenders may change their addresses or contact information for receiving notices."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9eb83712e5e65cd04210af22dead656a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LOANS OF NON-DEFAULTING LENDERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Loans of Non-Defaulting Lenders refer to the obligations that all lenders share when one lender fails to meet its financial commitments."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-ffdbb428153c0fe1a3165c4cb2b8b872</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BUSINESS DAY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Business Day is referred to in contexts of timelines for actions or responses related to the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Business Day refers to any day except weekends and public holidays where business operations are conducted."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Business Day refers to any day other than a Saturday, a Sunday, or any other day on which commercial banks are authorized to remain closed under the laws in New York City, New York."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Business Day refers to any day that is not a Saturday, Sunday, or any public holiday when financial institutions are closed for business."&lt;SEP&gt;"Business Day denotes any day on which financial institutions are open for business, impacting interest calculations and loan processing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Business Day is defined as any day that is not a Saturday, Sunday, or holiday recognized by the applicable jurisdiction."&lt;SEP&gt;"Business Day refers to any day on which commercial banks are open for business and transactions can take place."&lt;SEP&gt;"Business Day refers to the days on which financial institutions are open for business, impacting payment schedules."&lt;SEP&gt;"Business Day refers to the standard weekdays that are recognized for financial transactions."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-df1d1358e8eeda6882c1fa2a74d036e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7398756e5d9f35912e2cc6d9774a28be&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8390f90a484fc0fc4f7fecf58c01c94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-268cc623f7e435f27e78919cc7b8fd2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-75ccbedc285afc25e0e2e720079c8043&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ddd8481502608245741dc4772c5ff1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2b8cb98ea4aed2ec22248f62b71576b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de5a35f05e33d55963235061fcfdced5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9899bf9fb2f1e9c4c871968bb39877aa</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TERM CORRA BORROWING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Type of borrowing associated with Term CORRA Loans as defined in the text."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5c78c300be543864443a46def23942a2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHANGES OF ADDRESS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Changes of Address refer to the modifications parties must communicate to ensure successful delivery of legal notices and communications."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9eb83712e5e65cd04210af22dead656a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RECIPIENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CLIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Recipients are the entities that receive payments from Borrowers under the loan agreements and may include the Administrative Agent or Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The 'Recipient' in this context refers to an entity or person that receives funds, potentially as tax refunds or other financial amounts, under certain terms and conditions."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9899bf9fb2f1e9c4c871968bb39877aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6dfde67bcc6c4100358b49b218bb541</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BENCHMARK&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Benchmark refers to a standard or point of reference in financial markets that indicates the performance of an index or measurement against which other performance can be compared."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-df1d1358e8eeda6882c1fa2a74d036e0</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TERM CORRA NOTICE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Notification to Lenders and the Company regarding Term CORRA Transition Event."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Term CORRA Notice informs parties involved of relevant changes regarding the Term CORRA Transition Event affecting loans."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2eab36c3a28bbe2353185d3b7d97705d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c78c300be543864443a46def23942a2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INDEMNITEE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CLIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Persons or entities that are protected and indemnified under the terms of the Loan Agreement."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b1d195b7a76abc77df57b5e98867e935</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EXCESS TAXES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Excluded Taxes are specific taxes that may not be indemnified by Borrowers in this document."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c6dfde67bcc6c4100358b49b218bb541</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BORROWERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CLIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Borrowers are entities that receive loans from the Lenders, including the Company as a primary borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrowers are parties that receive loans and are responsible for repaying them according to loan agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrowers encompass all entities or individuals who engage in borrowing loans as specified in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrowers generally means individuals or entities that take on debt or larger loans from a lender for various purposes, such as buying property or funding operations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Different parties that are receiving loans and are responsible for repayments and adherence to loan documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Entities or individuals who take Loans from the lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to multiple borrowers who are subject to provisions of the loan agreements and regulatory compliance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrowers may borrow under this Section, prepay under Section 2.03, and reborrow under this Section."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-fdd35a29472aa8b0d59ccabafd832cb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df1d1358e8eeda6882c1fa2a74d036e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2b8cb98ea4aed2ec22248f62b71576b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a32da08942b4e8f9bb0977d0f91b0056&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f13c79bc5efcb269ff90c5b5cdf07eb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a80e94d1815c3927a9d45e840b95ae93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96327e67f3059bf562671f661d306a08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-268cc623f7e435f27e78919cc7b8fd2e</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TERM CORRA TRANSITION EVENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Event when Term CORRA is recommended for use, triggering a possible transition in benchmarks."&lt;SEP&gt;"Term CORRA Transition Event signifies a shift in the benchmark that affects certain loan agreements linked to Canadian Dollars."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2eab36c3a28bbe2353185d3b7d97705d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c78c300be543864443a46def23942a2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;APPLICABLE PERCENTAGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The fraction used to determine each Lender's portion of liability related to indemnified expenses."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b1d195b7a76abc77df57b5e98867e935</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BENEFICIAL OWNERSHIP REGULATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A regulation that outlines the requirements concerning the disclosure and verification of individuals or organizations that ultimately own or control a business entity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Beneficial Ownership Regulation mandates that entities disclose their beneficial owners to promote transparency and prevent illicit activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regulations requiring organizations to identify and verify individuals who ultimately own or control them."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-1ddd8481502608245741dc4772c5ff1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df1d1358e8eeda6882c1fa2a74d036e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffdbb428153c0fe1a3165c4cb2b8b872</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;U.S. GOVERNMENT SECURITIES BUSINESS DAY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Specific business days when certain trading activities occur for U.S. government securities."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5c78c300be543864443a46def23942a2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CODE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LAW"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Code refers to the Internal Revenue Code that governs tax regulations and withholding requirements affecting Borrowers."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c6dfde67bcc6c4100358b49b218bb541</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RELATED INDEMNITEE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CLIENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Subsidiaries or affiliates of Indemnitees that may also be protected under the Loan Agreement."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-b1d195b7a76abc77df57b5e98867e935</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHANGE IN LAW&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An event that constitutes the occurrence of a change in any law, rule, regulation, or treaty affecting an agreement or contract."&lt;SEP&gt;"Change in Law refers to amendments in legislation that may impact the financial obligations of the parties in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Change in Law refers to modifications in legal regulations that may impose additional costs or requirements on lenders and borrowers."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-df1d1358e8eeda6882c1fa2a74d036e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e9860cd859370389b2050b0328b04dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2eab36c3a28bbe2353185d3b7d97705d</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;US DOLLAR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CURRENCY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The lawful currency of the United States."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-5c78c300be543864443a46def23942a2</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INVESTMENT DOCUMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Investment Documents encompass any legal agreements or documents associated with loans and financial endorsements."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-c6dfde67bcc6c4100358b49b218bb541</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FINAL JUDGMENT&quot;">
