    <node id="&quot;CDO RATE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
      <data key="d1">"CDO Rate is a benchmark rate that is referenced for structuring some of the loans issued to the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"CDO Rate refers to the average rate applicable to Canadian bankers' acceptances, as displayed on the Reuters Screen CDOR Page for the applicable period."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Canadian Dollar Offered Rate, reflecting the interest rates at which Canadian banks lend Canadian dollars."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-df1d1358e8eeda6882c1fa2a74d036e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-100b5c975572f51636a61ac78458e899&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e9860cd859370389b2050b0328b04dc</data>
