    <node id="&quot;LOAN DOCUMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Any agreement or instrument pursuant to which a Lender and Borrower agree on the terms of the loan they are engaging in."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any agreement, instrument or other document as from time to time amended, supplemented or otherwise modified."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any documentation relating to loans that prescribes the rights and obligations of the parties involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any formal document relating to a loan agreement between borrowers and lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any official documentation that outlines the terms and conditions associated with a loan, including repayment schedules and interest rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legal documentation outlining the terms and conditions of a loan, including obligations and rights of lenders and borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Document encompasses agreements that define the obligations and rights of the Borrower and Lender with respect to Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Documents are the legal papers governing the loan between the Company, Lender, and Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Documents consist of formal agreements or contracts that define the terms and conditions pertaining to Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Documents refer to agreements that outline the terms and conditions agreed between Lenders and the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Official documents outlining the terms, conditions, and responsibilities related to loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan Document encompasses all agreements, notes, and contracts related to the loan transactions between Borrowers and Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan Document outlines the terms, conditions, and responsibilities involved in borrowing arrangements, including benchmarks and interest rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan Document refers to the legal texts and agreements governing loans secured by the Company, outlining various rights and obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The text refers to any loan document that governs the dealings and agreements of the parties involved."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-df1d1358e8eeda6882c1fa2a74d036e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43f64dca73b44adedaebc2187f68b166&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffdbb428153c0fe1a3165c4cb2b8b872&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d5393964f1cfdb9294f3a9925fe0c93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8390f90a484fc0fc4f7fecf58c01c94&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1d195b7a76abc77df57b5e98867e935&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5717298fa5f49a605f27b8da65de0aa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-100b5c975572f51636a61ac78458e899&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4112e65b1f4508cbb34a7b3f96ce6ae4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f13c79bc5efcb269ff90c5b5cdf07eb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0fee4592c80d303ac12e768cc7a7f8eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ddd8481502608245741dc4772c5ff1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2b8cb98ea4aed2ec22248f62b71576b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1348b3bb0f9a013e8a032d2005afa392&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2eab36c3a28bbe2353185d3b7d97705d</data>
    </node>
