    <edge source="&quot;COMPANY&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
      <data key="d3">97.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Administrative Agent acts on behalf of the Company and Lenders to manage loan responsibilities and payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent acts on behalf of the Company to manage communications with the Lenders, particularly regarding benchmarks."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent facilitates the transactions between the company and the lenders, ensuring proper communication and processes."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent manages the loan process that involves the Company and the Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent manages the loan transaction process for the Company, acting as an intermediary between the Company and the Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent operates on behalf of the Company as well as the Lenders in managing the Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent oversees compliance and coordination with the Company regarding its funding obligations under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company engages the Administrative Agent for management and execution of loan transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company interacts closely with the Administrative Agent during loan processes."|&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company interacts with the Administrative Agent for compliance and oversight of loan agreements.".&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is involved in the administrative processes of managing loans and communications as directed by the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is required to provide notices to the Administrative Agent for the execution of loan agreements and related activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company must consent to certain assignments and is involved with the Administrative Agent in facilitating these transactions."</data>
      <data key="d5">"Agency Relationship"&lt;SEP&gt;"Agency Role"&lt;SEP&gt;"Compliance Management"&lt;SEP&gt;"Consent"&lt;SEP&gt;"Intermediary Role"&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Management"&lt;SEP&gt;"Management Relationship"&lt;SEP&gt;"Management","","Operational Relationship"&lt;SEP&gt;"Notice Protocol"&lt;SEP&gt;"compliance"&lt;SEP&gt;Operational Interaction|&lt;SEP&gt;Transaction Facilitation&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;contractual relationship&lt;</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-fdd35a29472aa8b0d59ccabafd832cb5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43f64dca73b44adedaebc2187f68b166&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d5393964f1cfdb9294f3a9925fe0c93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9eb83712e5e65cd04210af22dead656a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0ef17404552acd85a5f0a9f77bf1ba4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5717298fa5f49a605f27b8da65de0aa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21340a4ca77d2f915d79e5381c251e61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f13c79bc5efcb269ff90c5b5cdf07eb2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6dfde67bcc6c4100358b49b218bb541&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2b8cb98ea4aed2ec22248f62b71576b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ddd8481502608245741dc4772c5ff1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f7bd63830876e1fb1213d6af99f3a8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2eab36c3a28bbe2353185d3b7d97705d</data>
