      <data key="d4">"The Company borrows from the Lender under the defined agreement, establishing a financial relationship based on loan provisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company borrows funds from the Lender according to the Loan Document.".&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company borrows money from the Lender under the terms outlined in the Loan Documents, establishing a client-service provider relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company has a borrowing relationship with lenders outlined in Loan agreements where certain conditions may affect business operations."|&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company must communicate notices and information to the Lenders as part of the loan administration process."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company owes amounts to the Lender under an agreement, establishing a financial obligation relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender extends financial support in the form of loans to the Company based on the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender provides loans to the Company under the terms outlined in the Loan Documents."&lt;</data>
