    <edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
      <data key="d3">92.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Any Lender engages in financial agreements with Borrowers to provide loans.".&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrowers are the clients of Lenders, borrowing under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrowers are the clients receiving funds from Lenders under the Loan Documents, establishing a borrower-lender relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrowers interact with Lenders to obtain loans, indicating a client-provider relationship."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders provide funds to Borrowers under the terms specified in the loan agreements."."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders provide funds to Borrowers who agree to repay these funds under agreed terms, indicating a financial relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders provide funds to Borrowers, who are then obligated to repay the loans under the terms of a loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders provide loans to Borrowers and have Total Credit Exposures impacting their agreements."|&gt;"loans"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is responsible for repaying the loan provided by the Lender, creating a debtor-creditor relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower receives loans from the Lender under the specified terms of the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender provides loans to the Borrower as outlined in the Loan Document."</data>
      <data key="d5">"Borrowing"&lt;SEP&gt;"Debtor-Creditor Relationship"&lt;SEP&gt;"Finance Relationship"&lt;SEP&gt;"Financial Transaction"&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Issuance"&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Provision"&lt;SEP&gt;"financial agreements"&lt;SEP&gt;"lending relationship"&lt;SEP&gt;7&lt;SEP&gt;Loan Provision&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;loan</data>
