    <edge source="&quot;LENDER&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
      <data key="d3">77.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Administrative Agents facilitate loans from Lenders to Borrowers by managing the process, indicating a supportive relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent acts on behalf of the Lender in managing the loan agreements and ensuring compliance by the Borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent acts on behalf of the Lenders to manage the loan agreements and borrower communications."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent coordinates between the Lender and Borrower for loan management and compliance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent facilitates communication and governs the agreements between the Lenders and the Borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent facilitates communication and transactions between the Lender and the Company, implying a collaborative relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent oversees the actions of the Lenders in compliance with the loan agreements."."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent represents multiple Lenders in the arrangement of the loans under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent represents the Lender and facilitates communications and transactions outlined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent represents the Lenders and is responsible for delivering notices and communications on their behalf."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender authorizes the Administrative Agent to manage and execute claims or returns related to loan payments."</data>
      <data key="d5">"Authorization"&lt;SEP&gt;"Facilitative Role"&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Facilitation"&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Management"&lt;SEP&gt;"Management"&lt;SEP&gt;"Process Facilitation"&lt;SEP&gt;"Representation"&lt;SEP&gt;"management"&lt;SEP&gt;management</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e35c16e351795670d18ad6d77423f4e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43f64dca73b44adedaebc2187f68b166&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9eb83712e5e65cd04210af22dead656a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e9860cd859370389b2050b0328b04dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5717298fa5f49a605f27b8da65de0aa3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-268cc623f7e435f27e78919cc7b8fd2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4015d17cdefaed939b54860ada7329d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c27cff3d0a152feb2e0548cd9db039db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ddd8481502608245741dc4772c5ff1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de5a35f05e33d55963235061fcfdced5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9899bf9fb2f1e9c4c871968bb39877aa</data>
    </edge>
